            new MessageRule("\\AThe\\ ring\\ is\\ plain\\ and\\ featureless,\\ but\\ you\\ somehow\\ feel\\ that\\ there\\ is\\ more\\ to\\ it\\ than\\ that\\.\\z", "这枚戒指朴实无华，但你隐约觉得它绝非表面看上去那么简单。", "ss,", 91, 0, 0),
